    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 23,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## FlexLM licence usage report\n**Period:** ${__from:date:DD/MM/YYYY} → ${__to:date:DD/MM/YYYY}  ·  **Vendors:** ${vendor:text}\n\nStatus: **Saturated** = all licences taken > 5% of the time · **Healthy** · **Under-used** = < 20% on average · **Never used** = no checkout in the period. Usage is sampled every minute: very short checkouts (a few seconds) may not be counted."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Licence features tracked",
      "description": "Number of licence features (counted licences) reported by the FlexLM servers for the selected vendors.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(max by(app, name) (max_over_time(flexlm_feature_issued{app=~\"$vendor\"}[$__range])) > 0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Average fill rate",
      "description": "Average share of the purchased licences that was in use over the period (all features together).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * sum(max by(app, name) (avg_over_time(flexlm_feature_used{app=~\"$vendor\"}[$__range])) and on(app, name) (max by(app, name) (max_over_time(flexlm_feature_issued{app=~\"$vendor\"}[$__range])) > 0)) / sum(max by(app, name) (max_over_time(flexlm_feature_issued{app=~\"$vendor\"}[$__range])) > 0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Never used in the period",
      "description": "Features that were never checked out during the whole period: candidates for a contract review.",
